# Go
bin/
# NOTE: do NOT add "pkg/" here. Modern Go modules don't emit a pkg/
# directory; the GOPATH-style cache lives in ~/go/pkg, outside the repo.
# An unqualified "pkg/" pattern also matches our legitimate
# apps/runtime/pkg/sdk/ source directory (the public Plugin SDK) and
# silently dropped it from version control earlier.
*.test
*.prof
coverage.out
coverage.html

# Stray dev artifacts (ad-hoc `go build .` outputs at repo root + a
# third-party Swagger dump from earlier API exploration).
/isobuilder
/swagger_nutanix.json
# `go build ./cmd/...` run from the agent module dir / repo root drops the
# binary here (name matches the module dir, so these MUST stay anchored — an
# unanchored pattern would also ignore the apps/ahv-remote-console-agent/
# source dir).
/apps/ahv-remote-console-agent/ahv-remote-console-agent
/ahv-remote-console-agent

